Package: ArchGrader
Title: Deterministic Rubric-Based Grading of Quarto Assignments
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("John", email = "ashikece8@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Grades student Quarto (.qmd) assignments in R against a YAML
    rubric by running each submission in a clean R process, comparing
    named result objects to an instructor solution, and rendering
    plain-language feedback reports. No LLM, no randomness: the same
    rubric and inputs always give the same score.
